Name [text box] - Comment
Shows the name of the object here, either the predefined name or a name that you specify. To change the
name, double-click and type over it.
Remarks
You can type in a combination of letters, digits, and underscore (_) characters, for example MyComment,
MyComment1, My_Comment_1. The name of an object cannot start with a digit, i.e., you cannot type in
1Comment.
