Tab Comment [Comment]
11-4558 Plant Simulation Help
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

◦ For each paragraph format property you may:
◊ Set the alignment: Align Left, Center, or Align Right.
◊ Set an indentation with Bullets.
• Or copy text you formatted in a word processing application that works with rich text format (.rtf),
such as the MS Windows WordPad or MS Word, to the clipboard and paste that text, including all of its
formatting properties into the text box.
• Or type text into the text box, copy it back to the word processing application, apply formatting and
paste it back to the text box. Press Ctrl+A to select all of the text into the text box, Ctrl+C to copy the
text, and Ctrl+V to paste it.
To open a window that only shows the comment you typed in, without formatting and editing options,
click the Comment object with the right mouse button and select Open Comment Window on the context
menu.
